Event Listing
    Show all events happening in the city with image, title, date, location.

Event Details + RSVP (“I’m Going”)
   When user clicks an event:
        full details
        RSVP button
        event info

Who’s Going (Real-Time)
    Show the list of people attending the event.

User Login + Profile (My Events)
        User logs in → sees all events they RSVP’d.

Certificate Feature 
1. Admin Uploads Certificate Design
        Admin can upload:
            A background image (certificate template)
            A logo/photo
            A signature
            Title text like “Certificate of Participation”

2. System Automatically Fills User Name
        When a user RSVPs or attends the event:
        Their name is taken from Supabase Auth
        Placed automatically on the certificate design

3. Admin Can Add Custom Text
     Admin can set:
        Event name
        Participation message
        Organizer name
        Date
        Example:
        “This certificate is awarded to Gopichand for participating in the Local Tech Meetup 2025.”

4. Download Certificate (PDF/JPG)
    User clicks Download Certificate →
        They get a PDF or image with:
        Their name
        Event name
        Admin design
        Signature

5. Optional: QR Code
        You can also add a QR code that:
        Confirms certificate is real
        Leads to a page showing event + user name

